es&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-euphoric-crown">Euphoric Crown</button></h4><p>LORD EXULTANT model only. This model’s melee attacks have +1 S.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="howling-plate" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-howling-plate">Howling Plate</button></h4><p>LORD EXULTANT model only. This unit’s ranged attacks have +1 AP.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="mercurial-host" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Mercurial Host</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-intoxicating-musk" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-intoxicating-musk">Intoxicating Musk</button></h4><p>Each time a melee attack targets the bearer's unit, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than the Toughness characteristic of that unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-loathsome-dexterity" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-loathsome-dexterity">Loathsome Dexterity</button></h4><p>Each time a model in the bearer's unit makes a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move, it can move through enemy models. When doing so, it can move within Engagement Range of such models, but cannot end that move within Engagement Range of them, and any Desperate Escape test is automatically passed.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-steeped-in-suffering" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-steeped-in-suffering">Steeped in Suffering</button></h4><p>Each time a model in the bearer's unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit below its Starting Strength, add 1 to the Hit roll. If that target is also Below Half-Strength, add 1 to the Wound roll as well.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-tactical-perfection" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-tactical-perfection">Tactical Perfection</button></h4><p>After both players have deployed their armies, select up to two Emperor's Children units from your army and redeploy them. When doing so, you can set those units up in Strategic Reserves if you wish, regardless of how many units are already in Strategic Reserves.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="peerless-bladesmen" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Peerless Bladesmen</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-blinding-speed" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 25 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-blinding-speed">Blinding Speed</button></h4><p>Once per battle, at the start of the Fight phase, the bearer can use this Enhancement. If it does so, until the end of the phase, models in the bearer's unit have the Fights First ability.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-distortion" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 25 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-distortion">Distortion</button></h4><p>Add 1 to the Attacks and Damage characteristics of melee weapons equipped by the bearer.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-rise-to-the-challenge" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 30 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-rise-to-the-challenge">Rise to the Challenge</button></h4><p>Once per battle, at the end of the Fight phase, if the bearer is within Engagement Range of three or more enemy models, it can use this Enhancement. If it does, the bearer can fight one additional time. When doing so, you can select one ability using the Exquisite Swordsmanship Detachment rule to apply to those attacks.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="rapid-evisceration" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Rapid Evisceration</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-accomplished-tactician" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 35 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-accomplished-tactician">Accomplished Tactician</button></h4><p>Once per turn, in your opponent's Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot, you can select one friendly Emperor's Children unit within 9&quot; of the bearer that was hit by one or more of those attacks, then select one friendly Transport that unit is wholly within 6&quot; of and is able to embark within. That Emperor's Children unit can embark in that Transport.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-heretek-adept" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 35 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-heretek-adept">Heretek Adept</button></h4><p>Once per battle round, when a saving throw is failed for a friendly Emperor's Children Vehicle model within 6&quot; of the bearer, you can change the Damage characteristic of that attack to 0.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-spearhead-striker" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-spearhead-striker">Spearhead Striker</button></h4><p>Each time the bearer disembarks from a Transport, until the end of the turn, you can re-roll Charge rolls made for the bearer's unit and enemy units cannot use the Fire Overwatch Stratagem to shoot at the bearer's unit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-sublime-presence" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 25 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-sublime-presence">Sublime Presence</button></h4><p>Once per turn, in your Movement phase, the bearer can use this Enhancement. If it does, select one friendly Emperor's Children Transport that is in Strategic Reserves. Until the end of the phase, for the purposes of setting up that Transport on the battlefield, treat the current battle round number as being one higher than it actually is.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="slaaneshs-chosen" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Slaanesh's Chosen</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-eager-to-prove" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-eager-to-prove">Eager to Prove</button></h4><p>You can re-roll Charge rolls made for the bearer's unit. While the bearer's unit is your army's Favoured Champions, add 2&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in that unit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-proud-and-vainglorious" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-proud-and-vainglorious">Proud and Vainglorious</button></h4><p>You can re-roll Battle-shock and Leadership tests taken for the bearer's unit. While the bearer's unit is your army's Favoured Champions, add 1 to the Objective Control characteristics of models in that unit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-repulsed-by-weakness" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 25 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-repulsed-by-weakness">Repulsed by Weakness</button></h4><p>Each time an enemy unit (excluding Monster and Vehicle units) within Engagement Range of the bearer's unit Falls Back, models in that enemy unit must take Desperate Escape tests. When doing so, if the bearer's unit is your army's Favoured Champions, subtract 1 from each of those Desperate Escape tests.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-slayer-of-champions" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh&quot;,&quot;unit-daemon-prince-of-slaanesh-with-wings&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-exultant&quot;,&quot;unit-lord-kakophonist&quot;,&quot;unit-sorcerer&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-slayer-of-champions">Slayer of Champions</button></h4><p>The bearer's melee weapons have the [Precision] ability, and each time the bearer makes a melee attack that targets a Character unit, improve the Strength and Armour Penetration characteristics of that attack by 1.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="spectacle-of-slaughter" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Spectacle of Slaughter</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="honour-is-for-fools" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-flawless-blades&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;selected-to-fight&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-stratagem-honour-is-for-fools">Honour is for Fools</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase, when a friendly FLAWLESS BLADES unit is selected to fight.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>That FLAWLESS BLADES unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit’s melee attacks have [PRECISION].</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="single-minded-strike" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-flawless-blades&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;started-charge-move&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-stratagem-single-minded-strike">Single-minded Strike</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Charge phase, when a friendly FLAWLESS BLADES unit starts a charge move.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>That FLAWLESS BLADES unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit can move through models (excluding MONSTER/VEHICLE models).</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="intoxicated-by-triumph" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-flawless-blades&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;enemy-ended-fall-back-after-engagement&quot;,&quot;not-within-engagement-range&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-stratagem-intoxicated-by-triumph">Intoxicated by Triumph</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit that was engaged with a friendly FLAWLESS 